The reference is divided in to "chapters", each of which has its own table of
contents.  Type:

    help osh-$CHAPTER

Where $CHAPTER is one of:

    type-method
    builtin-cmd
    stdlib
    front-end
    cmd-lang
    osh-assign
    word-lang
    mini-lang
    option
    special-var
    plugin

Example:

    help osh-word-lang
